OL,3,GNEWSANursery fees to increase six      
OL,4,Amonths before closure                  
OL,6,FParents have said they are "confused   
OL,7,Fand insulted" as fees at 10 publicly   
OL,8,Frun nurseries due to close in July will
OL,9,Fincrease by 4%.                        
OL,11,FThe plan to axe South Tyneside         
OL,12,FAccredited Network for Learning in the 
OL,13,FEarly Years (STANLEYs) by July next    
OL,14,Fyear was confirmed on 23 September,    
OL,15,Fdespite protests by parents and staff. 
OL,17,FSouth Tyneside Council said the charges
OL,18,Fwere part of a standard annual uplift  
OL,19,Fto local authority fees and charges    
OL,20,Ffrom February 1, 2027.                 
