OL,3,GNEWSANursery fees to increase six      
OL,4,Amonths before closure                  
OL,6,FJoanna Taylor, a parent who campaigned 
OL,7,Fto save the nurseries, said: "You're   
OL,8,Fpenalising the parents who are there   
OL,9,Fand staying to the end."               
